 with tubal ectopic pregnancies</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1999</year><volume>341</volume><fpage>1974</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10607814</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><article-title>Medical treatment of ectopic pregnancy: The practice committee of the American society of reproductive</article-title><source>Fertil Steril</source><year>2008</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>S206</fpage><lpage>12</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19007632</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Portundo</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ochoa</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gomez</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Uribaron</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fertility and contraception of 8 patients with ovarian pregnancy</article-title><source>Int J Fertil</source><year>1984</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>254</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6152450</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>